1
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:19,200
(Penny:)Okay, help me out here.

2
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,840
How does an archeology professor
get that good with a whip?

3
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:25,410
(Howard:)Maybe he took a class
at the adult bookstore.

4
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:27,040
(Howard:)That's how I learned.

5
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,840
I can't believe you've never
seen Raiders of the Lost Ark.

6
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:33,650
And I can't believe you've
never read Eat, Pray, Love.

7
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:35,120
(Leonard:)When she comes out with

8
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:37,850
Eat, Pray, Run Away From A
Giant Boulder, I'll read it.

9
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:42,860
I don't care if Eat, Pray, Love
changed your life,

10
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:45,790
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)I'm not reading it.

11
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:48,060
(Penny:)You know, I could totally
rock a hat like that.

12
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:50,800
(Sheldon:)That's the work of noted
Hollywood costume designer

13
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:51,900
(Sheldon:)Deborah Nadoolman.

14
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:53,230
(Sheldon:)She also designed

15
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,570
(Sheldon:)the iconic red and black jacket

16
00:00:54,570 --> 00:00:56,440
in Michael Jackson's
Thriller video,

17
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:58,410
(Sheldon:)which I've never viewed
in its entirety,

18
00:00:58,410 --> 00:00:59,790
(Sheldon:)as I find zombies dancing

19
00:00:59,790 --> 00:01:03,020
(Sheldon:)in choreographed synchronicity
implausible.

